Package: visnyk
Version: 0.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Visnyk Team <team@visnyk.local>
Description: broadcast messenger for WA, TG, Viber
 Checks number availability and delivers to all available messengers.
 Uses a single personal account per messenger.
 0.1.1: added direct send — Send WA and Send TG buttons alongside
 broadcast to all. Direct send targets one messenger without fallback
 and reports contact not found or send failure. Delay 8-15s preserved.
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Homepage: https://github.com/visnyk/visnyk
